      "value": "@{5adfa711a8ca626f7bf243ae|full_name}: Performance is a reason to not allow everyone to have cameras.\n\nAnd the Trust System is _not_ a performance system. The fact that it can be used that way is an \"off label\" use of it.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
