      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{58c6cbcffd04b1785f747b6c|full_name}: from what I understand, cameras were made friends-only due to an exploit that allowed you to take over people's viewpoints. Performance is just one reason why they're probably hesitant to bring it back.\n\nI wouldn't mind seeing camera toggles be included in an upcoming \"performance system\", once they iron out any exploits.\n\nYou make a good point, cameras probably don't need their own section in the trust system at all. They could just fall under \"Shaders\" as far as safety is concerned.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
